    <briefdescription>
<para>Module to hold pointer and stack data for use in <ref refid="group__mpp" kindref="compound">MPP</ref> modules. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Makes stack and pointer data publicly available from <ref refid="mpp__data__mpi_8inc_source" kindref="compound">mpp_data_mpi.inc</ref> or <ref refid="mpp__data__nocomm_8inc_source" kindref="compound">mpp_data_nocomm.inc</ref> for use in <ref refid="group__mpp" kindref="compound">MPP</ref> modules. This module is mainly for internal use within <ref refid="group__mpp__mod" kindref="compound">mpp_mod</ref> and <ref refid="group__mpp__domains__mod" kindref="compound">mpp_domains_mod</ref> . </para>    </detaileddescription>
